><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357590/extras/dd8eea393d9fe9d03ea6b74d3f92ffae.poster.avif?t=1740421662\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357590/extras/dd8eea393d9fe9d03ea6b74d3f92ffae.webm?t=1740421662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357590/extras/dd8eea393d9fe9d03ea6b74d3f92ffae.mp4?t=1740421662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enjoy a <strong>concise</strong>, <strong>impactful</strong> set of skill that will carry you through your journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The seemingly simple set of stats the player has access to will have many far-reaching impacts throughout <i>Shadows of Morhaven</i>, far beyond simple combat numbers. With <strong>4 equipment slots</strong>, including a main-hand, off-hand, armor, and accessory slots, there are countless possible combinations of gear, expanded even further by the rarity stat roll system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357590/extras/9b6e319e0c74074f1ad4296f13444a3c.poster.avif?t=1740421662\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357590/extras/9b6e319e0c74074f1ad4296f13444a3c.webm?t=1740421662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357590/extras/9b6e319e0c74074f1ad4296f13444a3c.mp4?t=1740421662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No RPG is complete without a diverse cast to <strong>interact</st